    @startuml C2_Create_Vessel_Visit_Execution_Process_View
    title C2 – Create Vessel Visit Execution (Process View)

    actor "Logistics Operator" as LogisticsOp
    participant "Frontend Web Application\n(React / Angular)" as Frontend
    participant "Vessel Visit Execution API\n(ASP.NET Core Web API)" as API
    participant "External IAM Provider\n(SSO / OAuth 2.0)" as IAM
    database "PLMS Database\n(SQL / EF Core)" as DB


    LogisticsOp -> Frontend : Login (Credenciais)
    Frontend -> IAM : Solicita token de autenticação
    IAM --> Frontend : Retorna Access Token (JWT)


    LogisticsOp -> Frontend : Submete formulário (novo VVE com VVN selecionado)
    Frontend -> API : POST /api/VesselVisitExecutions (JSON + Token JWT)
    API -> IAM : Valida Token (OAuth 2.0)
    IAM --> API : Token válido


    API -> DB : Valida VVN existente
    DB --> API : VVN encontrado (OK)

    API -> API : Gera identificador VVE\nRegistra arrival time\nAssigna creator user ID\nMarca como "In Progress"

    API -> DB : INSERT INTO VesselVisitExecutions (...)
    DB --> API : Confirma inserção (OK)


    API --> Frontend : HTTP 201 Created + VVEDTO (status: In Progress)
    Frontend --> LogisticsOp : Mostra confirmação e novo VVE

    @enduml
